    "how": "Based on the tweet only: the idea is to make the reasoning and intent behind each change readable, because agents write more code than you can read. The exact mechanism could not be checked.",
    "links": [],
    "tag": "free",
    "title": "Vistara: read your agents' reasons instead of their code",
    "try": "Free on Mac. Site not reachable from the session, limited details.",
